<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/36b2a2fc8eae> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "“It’s so alarming when we see the tools that are sold to the public as away to fight terrorism and violent crime being used to silence dissent,” said Albert Fox Cahn, executive director of the Surveillance Technology Oversight Project." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9270" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/45d67cf27650> a airo:Evidence ;
